msgstr "Uvoz Paketa - \\usepackage{}"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:35
#, kde-format
msgid "Package Import"
msgstr "Uvoz Paketa"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:36
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Any options given in the \\documentclass command that are unknown by the "
"selected document class\n"
"are passed on to the packages loaded with \\usepackage."
msgstr ""
"One opcije date u naredbi \\documentclass koje su nepoznate izabranoj klasi "
"dokumenta\n"
"prosljeđuju se paketima učitanim preko \\usepackage."

#: kilestdactions.cpp:39
#, kde-format
msgid "AMS Packages"
msgstr "AMS paketi"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:39
#, kde-format
msgid "The principal American Mathematical Society packages"
msgstr "Osnovni paketi Američkog matematičkog društva"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:40
#, kde-format
msgid "Start Document Body - \\begin{document}"
msgstr "Početak tijela dokumenta - \\begin{document}"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:40
#, kde-format
msgid "Start Document Body"
msgstr "Početak Tijela Dokumenta"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:40
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Text is allowed only between \\begin{document} and \\end{document}.\n"
"The 'preamble' (before \\begin{document} ) may contain declarations only."
msgstr ""
"Tekst je dozvoljen samo između \\begin{document} i \\end{document}.\n"
"Preambula (prije \\begin{document} ) može sadržati samo deklaracije."

#: kilestdactions.cpp:41
#, kde-format
msgid "Generate Title - \\maketitle"
msgstr "Stvaranje Naziva -  \\maketitle"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:41
#, kde-format
msgid "Generate Title"
msgstr "Stvaranje naziva"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:41
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This command generates a title on a separate title page\n"
"- except in the article class, where the title normally goes at the top of "
"the first page."
msgstr ""
"Ova naredba generiše naslov na posebnoj naslovnoj strani,\n"
"osim u klasi članaka, gdje naslov normalno ide na vrh prve strane."

#: kilestdactions.cpp:42
#, kde-format
msgid "Table of Contents - \\tableofcontents"
msgstr "Sadržaj - \\tableofcontents"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:42
#, kde-format
msgid "Put this command where you want the table of contents to go"
msgstr "Ovu naredbu stavite tamo gdje želite da bude sadržaj"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:43
#, kde-format
msgid "Title Definition - \\title{}"
msgstr "Naslov Definicije - \\title{}"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:43
#, kde-format
msgid "Title Definition"
msgstr "Naslov Definicije"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:43
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"\\title{text}\n"
"The \\title command declares text to be the title.\n"
"Use \\\\ to tell LaTeX where to start a new line in a long title."
msgstr ""
"\\title{tekst}\n"
"Naredba \\title deklariše tekst kao naslov.\n"
"Koristite \\\\ da biste rekli LaTeX-u gdje je početak novog reda u dugačkom "
"naslovu."

#: kilestdactions.cpp:44
#, kde-format
msgid "Author Definition - \\author{}"
msgstr "Autor Definicije - \\author{}"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:44
#, kde-format
msgid "Author Definition"
msgstr "Autor Definicije"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:44
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"\\author{names}\n"
"The \\author command declares the author(s), where names is a list of "
"authors separated by \\and commands."
msgstr ""
"\\author{imena}\n"
"Naredba \\author deklariše autore, gdje su „imena“ lista autora razdvojenih "
"naredbama \\and."

#: kilestdactions.cpp:46
#, kde-format
msgid "Center - \\begin{center}"
msgstr "Centriraj — \\begin{center}"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:46 kilestdactions.cpp:47 kilestdactions.cpp:48
#, kde-format
msgid "Each line must be terminated with the string \\\\."
msgstr "Svaki red mora da se završava sa \\\\."

#: kilestdactions.cpp:47
#, kde-format
msgid "Align Left - \\begin{flushleft}"
msgstr "Poravnjaj lijevo - \\begin{flushleft}"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:48
#, kde-format
msgid "Align Right - \\begin{flushright}"
msgstr "Poravnjaj desno - \\begin{flushright}"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:49
#, kde-format
msgid "Quote - \\begin{quote}"
msgstr "Citiraj — \\begin{quote}"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:49
#, kde-format
msgid "Quote"
msgstr "Citat"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:49
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The text is justified at both margins.\n"
"Leaving a blank line between text produces a new paragraph."
msgstr ""
"Tekst se poravnjava po obje margine.\n"
"Ostavljanje prazne linije između teksta rezultuje novim pasusom."

#: kilestdactions.cpp:50
#, kde-format
msgid "Quotation - \\begin{quotation}"
msgstr "Citat — \\begin{quotation}"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:50
#, kde-format
msgid "Quotation"
msgstr "Citiranje"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:50
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The text is justified at both margins and there is paragraph indentation.\n"
"Leaving a blank line between text produces a new paragraph."
msgstr ""
"Tekst se poravnjava po obje margine i postoji uvlačenje pasusa.\n"
"Ostavljanje prazne linije između teksta rezultuje novim pasusom."

#: kilestdactions.cpp:51
#, kde-format
msgid "Verse - \\begin{verse}"
msgstr "Stih — \\begin{verse}"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:51
#, kde-format
msgid "Verse"
msgstr "Stih"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:51
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The verse environment is designed for poetry.\n"
"Separate the lines of each stanza with \\\\, and use one or more blank lines "
"to separate the stanzas."
msgstr ""
"Stihovno okruženje je dizajnirano za poeziju.\n"
"Odvojite redove svake strofe sa \\\\, i koristite jednu ili više praznih "
"linija da biste razdvojili strofe."

#: kilestdactions.cpp:53
#, kde-format
msgid "Verbatim - \\begin{verbatim}"
msgstr "Doslovno — \\begin{verbatim}"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:53
#, kde-format
msgid "Environment that gets LaTeX to print exactly what you type in."
msgstr "Okruženje koje tjera LaTeX da štampa tačno ono što upišete."

#: kilestdactions.cpp:54
#, kde-format
msgid "Bulleted List - \\begin{itemize}"
msgstr "Popis oznaka - \\begin{itemize}"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:54
#, kde-format
msgid "Bulleted List"
msgstr "Popis oznaka"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:54
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The itemize environment produces a 'bulleted' list.\n"
"Each item of an itemized list begins with an \\item command."
msgstr ""
"Okruženje stavki proizvodi listu sa predznacima.\n"
"Svaka stavka liste počinje naredbom \\item."

#: kilestdactions.cpp:55
#, kde-format
msgid "Enumeration - \\begin{enumerate}"
msgstr "Nabrajanje — \\begin{enumerate}"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:55
#, kde-format
msgid "Enumeration"
msgstr "Nabrajač"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:55
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The enumerate environment produces a numbered list.\n"
"Each item of an enumerated list begins with an \\item command."
msgstr ""
"Nabrajačko okruženje proizvodi listu sa brojevima.\n"
"Svaka stavka liste počinje naredbom \\item."

#: kilestdactions.cpp:56
#, kde-format
msgid "Description - \\begin{description}"
msgstr "Opis — \\begin{description}"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:56
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The description environment is used to make labeled lists.\n"
"Each item of the list begins with an \\item[label] command.\n"
"The 'label' is bold face and flushed right."
msgstr ""
"Opisno okruženje služi za pravljenje označenih lista.\n"
"Svaka stavka liste počinje naredbom \\item[oznaka].\n"
"„Oznaka“ je napisana masnim slovima i poravnata desno."

#: kilestdactions.cpp:58
#, kde-format
msgid "Table - \\begin{table}"
msgstr "Tabela — \\begin{table}"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:58
#, kde-format
msgid "Table"
msgstr "Tabela"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:59
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"\\begin{table}[placement]\n"
"body of the table\n"
"\\caption{table title}\n"
"\\end{table}\n"
"Tables are objects that are not part of the normal text, and are usually "
"floated to a convenient place.\n"
"The optional argument [placement] determines where LaTeX will try to place "
"your table\n"
"h : Here - at the position in the text where the table environment appears\n"
"t : Top - at the top of a text page\n"
"b : Bottom - at the bottom of a text page\n"
"p : Page of floats - on a separate float page, which is a page containing no "
"text, only floats.\n"
"The body of the table is made up of whatever text or LaTeX commands, etc., "
"you wish.\n"
"The \\caption command allows you to title your table."
msgstr ""
"\\begin{tabela}[postavljanje]\n"
"tijelo tabele\n"
"\\caption{naziv tabele}\n"
"\\end{tabela}\n"
"Tabele su objekti koji nisu dio običnog teksta, i obično su smještene na "
"prikladnom mjestu.\n"
"Dodatni argument [postavljanje] određuje gdje će LaTeX pokušati postaviti "
"tabelu\n"
"h: Ovdje - na poziciji u tekstu gdje se pojavljuje okruženje tabele\n"
"t: Vrh - na vrhu stranice teksta\n"
"b: Dno - na dnu stranice teksta\n"
"p: Stranica postavljanja - na odvojenoj stranici za postavljanje, koja ne "
"sadrži tekst već samo postavljanje.\n"
"Tijelo tabele se sastoji od bilo kakvog teksta ili LaTeX komandi, itd., što "
"želite.\n"
"Komanda \\caption vam omogućava da odredite naziv vaše tabele."

#: kilestdactions.cpp:63
#, kde-format
msgid "Figure - \\begin{figure}"
msgstr "Slika — \\begin{figure}"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:63
#, kde-format
msgid "Figure"
msgstr "Slika"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:64
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"\\begin{figure}[placement]\n"
"body of the figure\n"
"\\caption{figure title}\n"
"\\end{figure}\n"
"Figures are objects that are not part of the normal text, and are usually "
"floated to a convenient place.\n"
"The optional argument [placement] determines where LaTeX will try to place "
"your figure\n"
"h : Here - at the position in the text where the figure environment appears\n"
"t : Top - at the top of a text page\n"
"b : Bottom - at the bottom of a text page\n"
"p : Page of floats - on a separate float page, which is a page containing no "
"text, only floats.\n"
"The body of the figure is made up of whatever text or LaTeX commands, etc., "
"you wish.\n"
"The \\caption command allows you to title your figure."
msgstr ""
"\\begin{lik}[postavljanje]\n"
"tijelo lika\n"
"\\caption{naziv lika}\n"
"\\end{lik}\n"
"Likovi su objekti koji nisu dio običnog teksta, i obično su smješteni na "
"prikladnom mjestu.\n"
"Dodatni argument [postavljanje] određuje gdje će LaTeX pokušati postaviti "
"lik\n"
"h: Ovdje - na poziciji u tekstu gdje se pojavljuje okruženje lika\n"
"t: Vrh - na vrhu stranice teksta\n"
"b: Dno - na dnu stranice teksta\n"
"p: Stranica postavljanja - na odvojenoj stranici za postavljanje, koja ne "
"sadrži tekst već samo postavljanje.\n"
"Tijelo lika se sastoji od bilo kakvog teksta ili LaTeX komandi, itd., što "
"želite.\n"
"Komanda \\caption vam omogućava da odredite naziv vašeg lika."

#: kilestdactions.cpp:68
#, kde-format
msgid "Title Page - \\begin{titlepage}"
msgstr "Naslov stranice - \\begin{naslovstranice}"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:68
#, kde-format
msgid "Title Page"
msgstr "Stranica naslova"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:69
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"\\begin{titlepage}\n"
"text\n"
"\\end{titlepage}\n"
"The titlepage environment creates a title page, i.e. a page with no printed "
